    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLEASE WISHLIST US!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/1689e97f637899a781227ee3c488fbcc.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1>Simple Video Recorder is an extremely easy to use and feature-packed video recording software.  Use this software to record your video games, desktop presentations, for sharing on Youtube, Steam, Vimeo, or anywhere online!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/0030b9c192c9bd55a2f07634f03f531a.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One click simple recording<br></li><li>High frame-rate supported<br></li><li>Crisp, clean, clear quality video<br></li><li>Full-screen video recording<br></li><li>User-defined video area recording<br></li><li>Captures both system audio as well as microphone audio<br></li><li>Fully supports watermarks / overlay additions</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/2ce0d80e65c78eca4cbb1b38623052af.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>This software will continually be developed to improve performance, add exciting buttons, and further increase the usability list of features provided!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/5aef05eb993f75d21661496c30b35839.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Easily Add Watermark/Overlay Image:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/2f412e774d36e44eb6a75eece54479c4.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Full Webcam Support:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/382728c52073a6dce860aa0cea7d2ecc.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Custom Recording Size:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ad1626f015bb3b553dddcb75393ed60e.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Super Easy Video Settings:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/194979cb6acb906a2c7282d2ccf03f24.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/1070c041fe6f257bdff7b8518d54a255.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Fantastic Microphone/Audio Support:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/9a290d244bb9d4d6de593bda820a9f45.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/e70158464aba6d6cbde6e077b914561d.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Simple Video Recorder is an extremely easy to use and feature-packed video recording software.  Use this software to record your video games, desktop presentations, for sharing on Youtube, Steam, Vimeo, or anywhere online!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/0030b9c192c9bd55a2f07634f03f531a.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One click simple recording<br></li><li>High frame-rate supported<br></li><li>Crisp, clean, clear quality video<br></li><li>Full-screen video recording<br></li><li>User-defined video area recording<br></li><li>Captures both system audio as well as microphone audio<br></li><li>Fully supports watermarks / overlay additions</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/2ce0d80e65c78eca4cbb1b38623052af.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>This software will continually be developed to improve performance, add exciting buttons, and further increase the usability list of features provided!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/5aef05eb993f75d21661496c30b35839.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Easily Add Watermark/Overlay Image:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/2f412e774d36e44eb6a75eece54479c4.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Full Webcam Support:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/382728c52073a6dce860aa0cea7d2ecc.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Custom Recording Size:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/ad1626f015bb3b553dddcb75393ed60e.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Super Easy Video Settings:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/194979cb6acb906a2c7282d2ccf03f24.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/1070c041fe6f257bdff7b8518d54a255.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><br>Fantastic Microphone/Audio Support:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/9a290d244bb9d4d6de593bda820a9f45.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1070520/extras/e70158464aba6d6cbde6e077b914561d.avif?t=1691097785\" /></div>",
